⸻

INFORMATION DENSITY

Keep screens breathable.

Avoid clutter.

Whitespace is a feature.

Not wasted space.

⸻

COMPONENT RULES

Components must be:

Reusable

Accessible

Consistent

Responsive

Documented

⸻

BUTTON RULES

Primary Button:

