Progress

Success

Navigation

State Changes

⸻

FORBIDDEN ANIMATIONS

Random animations

Decorative bouncing

Excessive movement

Attention grabbing effects

Animation spam

⸻

MOTION STYLE

Smooth

Natural

Subtle

Premium

Responsive

⸻

LOADING STATES

Every loading state must feel intentional.

Never show blank screens.

⸻

REQUIRED LOADING TYPES

