MOCKUP COMPONENT PATTERNS

Header:

Greeting or screen title left, profile or action icon right.

Level Card:

JLPT badge, progress percentage, Yama illustration, mountain accent.

Quest Card:

Title, description, progress bar, red accent border on active quest.

List Row:

Japanese primary text, furigana or reading secondary, English meaning, status icon right.

Primary CTA:

Full-width red Continue or action button pinned to bottom safe area.

JLPT Tabs:

Horizontal pill tabs: All, N5, N4, N3, N2, N1.

Bottom Navigation:

5–6 icon tabs with labels, active tab in Mountain Red.

